@host = http://localhost:5016
# Paste an access token acquired by the React app (see README "Getting a token manually").
@token = eyJ...

### Public - no token needed
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Protected - returns 401 without a valid bearer token
GET {{host}}/api/me

### Protected - with token
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List my todos
GET {{host}}/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a todo
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Try the Entra-protected API" }
